KDE 4.7 was built and installed to debian-ports about a week ago.  And I
have also seen the crash of plasma-desktop and kderunner appear after
the upgrade to KDE 4.7.

The backtrace of both crashes end in the pthread locking code in libc.
I am running a kernel with the futex fix so it can't be the same issue
we were seeing with pulseaudio.  I have not got around to making any bug
reports as yet --- this one could be in any of KDE, qt4-x11, libc or the
kernel.

